      "ects": 6.0,
      "semester": null,
      "university": "Universitat de Girona",
      "description": "The subject introduces various industrial manipulators, as well as the most common actuators and sensors. Direct, inverse, and differential kinematics will be addressed for the most common industrial manipulators, as well as dynamics, trajectory planning, and tracking. The subject not only delves into theory but also covers the programming of these manipulators for industrial tasks.",
